# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/*.o
src/STARDUST

# The user's local Makefile is copied from Makefile.template and edited with
# site-specific library paths; only the template is tracked (see docs/SETUP.md).
/src/Makefile

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STARDUST run outputs (generated at runtime, named "<pathID>_...")
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Precomputed integral tables
*_table_*.dat
# Radial profile outputs
*_profile_*.dat
# Fuku integral debug dumps
*log_fuku_integrals*
#
# NOTE: run logs are named "<pathID>_..._log_main" / "_log_debug". They are
# intentionally NOT ignored here, because the tests/ directories ship reference
# "*_log_main" files that must stay tracked. Delete stray run logs by hand, or
# add a per-directory rule if you run simulations outside tests/.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Apptainer / Singularity build outputs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sif
*.sandbox/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
